[[File:Aquanite icon.png|left]]
'''Aquanites''' are [[Slayer monster]]s found in the [[Ynysdail Cavern]] beneath [[Ynysdail]]. They require level 78 [[Slayer]] to fight, and Ynysdail requires level 73 [[Sailing]] to access. Aquanites can be assigned by [[Nieve]] and [[Duradel]] after purchasing the [[Lured In]] unlock for 80 [[Slayer reward point]]s, or by [[Mortimer]] regardless if Lured In has been unlocked. There is also a task extension unlock available for 100 points.

Aquanites can drop the unique [[aquanite tendon]], used to make the [[aquanite hopper]]. They have a very high drop rate for uncommon seeds compared to other monsters, notably coral [[frags]] and [[ranarr seed]]s.

If attacked with a weapon set to [[slash]], their lure will be severed and their [[stab]] defence will be reduced by 50 (from 60 to 10), displaying the message {{mes|Your attack cuts off the aquanite's lure!|colour=green}} This attack does not need to deal damage to sever the lure. This only happens when the [[Combat Options|attack option]] is set to slash; it is not sufficient to only use a [[special attack]] like the [[Dragon dagger]]'s, which rolls against [[Slash defence]].

With the [[Slayer Rewards|Bigger and Badder]] Slayer reward unlocked, there is a chance that an [[Elder aquanite]] will appear when killing aquanites on a [[slayer task]].

